# Rock material of the landscape pilot (step В3, reports/content/2026-11-landscape-pilot/b3-rock-material.md): the
# wall and the boulder by the road south of Akil's farm, a ledge seen from afar, the rock arch at the bandit camp,
# a walk along the wall, the wall at a low sun. The views of the layers probe; change them only with the note.
# Run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> and with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT= (the original), put the frames side by side.
# @timeout 900
